plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-08-07T18:28:31.831Z",codex-root,Expose the Core registry intelligence under hassio registries rather than a parallel top-level group.,"The operations share registry transport, privacy posture, output conventions, and user mental model.",Official Core 2026.8.1 config device/entity registry handlers and existing hassio registries command.
